   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Pioneering Efficiency for your Grinding Shop </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The greatest potential for efficiency lies outside the grinding machine: ZOLLER Solutions stand for your future - we make you more successful. Because those who manufacture faster and more efficiently operate more economically in order to be able to invest in the future. If economic progress is your goal, then ZOLLER is your partner.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2030",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h2> Software Functions </h2>",
      "body": "<h4>For maximum performance</h4>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c2028",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "360° concentricity test",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To automatically determine the concentricity of circular surfaces (e.g. tool shank) and graphically evaluate the entire contour.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/4/csm_software_rundlaufpruefung_074ba05353.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2047",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Point angle with hollow ground joint",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Is determined on drilling tools and hollow-ground tool cutting edges from the starting point (outside diameter) to the tool tip or the defined end point by contour tracing.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/8/csm_software_spitzewinkel_f7d99885f3.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2045",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Slot chip space scan",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Automatically scans the groove/chip space contour without contact and displays it graphically.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/c/csm_software_nutscan_4a0f6866e5.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2043",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Radius contour »contur« with graphic",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For automatic determination of concave and convex radii on the outer contour of tools, including adjustable angle sectors with graphical evaluation.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/0/csm_software_radiuskontur_f2b805a005.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2041",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Rake angle on radius cutters",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Determines the rake angle in the radius segment at the specified angles. Suitable for die, corner and full radius cutters.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/5/csm_software_spanwinkel_1e858e188a.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2039",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Contour measurement »lasso«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To scan any tool and workpiece contours and carry out a target/actual comparison or dimensioning of the contour.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/f/csm_software_lasso_2774d358f7.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2037",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Tool analysis »metis«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Measures and documents any contours, radii, angles, distances and defects (wear) in incident light.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/2/csm_software_metis_75f5607842.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2035",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Editable test report »apus«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To be able to display all measurement results including designations, target values, tolerances and much more in tabular form and flexibly in the layout.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/e/csm_software_apus_d369f092b1.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2033",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "ZOLLER »caz«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The virtual measuring device for the PC workstation for external creation of the testing and measuring process including measuring programs, target values and tolerances based on the 3D model of the tool before it is manufactured.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/5/csm_software_caz_99dbbf50e2.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2031",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
